            "skill_desc": "Deals massive Physical DMG to all targets and delays the action of the attacked targets. When using this ability, for every stack of \"All Wishes\" this unit has, DMG multiplier of \"Smite All Evil\" increases by a certain percentage. Afterward, clears the \"All Wishes\" stacks, and removes \"Weakness Protected\" from all friendly units and the \"Inspire\" effect.",
